abstract: "<p>This repository contains a Jupyter notebook and example geospatial data\
  \ for estimating mean lava-flow thickness, bulk and dense-rock equivalent volumes,\
  \ and time-averaged discharge rates from digital elevation models (DEMs). It updates\
  \ the lava-volume workflow in <a href=\"https://github.com/natturufraedistofnun/volcano_scripts\"\
  >volcano_scripts</a>. The main change is the use of xDEM to align the DEMs over\
  \ stable terrain before calculating elevation change.</p>\n<p>The included example\
  \ uses a pre-eruption DEM and a survey acquired on 11 July 2023 during the Litli\
  \ Hr\xFAtur eruption on Iceland's Reykjanes Peninsula. The notebook estimates discharge\
  \ and its uncertainty from eruption onset to the first survey or between successive\
  \ surveys.</p>"
